# Signing material. Never commit these. A .p12 holds the private key that
# proves software came from you; if it leaks, someone else can sign as you.
# The certificate belongs in your keychain, in GitHub Actions secrets, and in
# an offline backup. Not here.
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
